        :class:`StreamReceiptBatchCommitReceipt` and
        :class:`StreamReceiptBatch` encodings, ``end`` a lowercase hex
        string decoding to the canonical non-empty
        :class:`StreamCommitReceiptFrontier` encoding and ``mac`` a
